<title>HUNGARY: CESI index hits new record at 1,612.33 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index hits new record at 1,612.33 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index rose 0.1 percent or 1.66 points to end at a new record high of 1,612.33 points on Wednesday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
